(i) In Kreta Yug (also known as Satya Yug), Brahma worshipped;
(ii) In Treta Yug, Indra worshipped;
(iii) In Dwapara Yug, Boghar consecrated the deity for Dhandayudapani, and worshipped till the year 204 of Kaliyug;
(iv) From the year 205 of Kaliyug, Adhipulipani worshipped.
(v) Thereafter the book lists 11 Pulipani Pathira Udayar, commencing with Naina Pulipani Pathira Udayar and ending with Boganatha Pulipani Pathira Udayar (and he is now succeeded by the present plaintiff) as those who had worshipped the deity Dhandayudapani.
